      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-2000.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments of sections 96 and 101 of the Telecommunications\n(Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999 apply to each\nlevy quarter that commences after the day on which this Act receives\nthe Royal Assent.\n(2)\nThe amendments of section 100 of the Telecommunications (Consumer\nProtection and Service Standards) Act 1999 apply to each levy quarter\nafter the first levy quarter that commences after the day on which this\nAct receives the Royal Assent.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThe amendments of sections 96 and 101 of the Telecommunications\n(Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999 apply to each\nlevy quarter that commences after the day on which this Act receives\nthe Royal Assent.\n(2)\nThe amendments of section 100 of the Telecommunications (Consumer\nProtection and Service Standards) Act 1999 apply to each levy quarter\nafter the first levy quarter that commences after the day on which this\nAct receives the Royal Assent.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-2000-sch-1-sec-4-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f6270e20c52633129e985afeabe0f140c30d179ecaf59c2061a9b72fba5aff1a"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-2000#sch-1-sec-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4 Application",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments of sections 96 and 101 of the Telecommunications\n(Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999 apply to each\nlevy quarter that commences after the day on which this Act receives\nthe Royal Assent.\n(2)\nThe amendments of section 100 of the Telecommunications (Consumer\nProtection and Service Standards) Act 1999 apply to each levy quarter\nafter the first levy quarter that commences after the day on which this\nAct receives the Royal Assent."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-2000-sch-1-sec-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
